    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you takes damage, you can take a Reaction to make your Arcane Ward absorb that damage. If this damage reduces the ward to 0 Hit Points, the warded creature takes any remaining damage. If that creature has any Resistances or Vulnerabilities, apply them before reducing the ward's Hit Points.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-R3yBaWd65hBywQrO\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Spend the absorbed damage from your Arcane Ward uses.</p></section>",
